{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269b9c0QA4nf1795763788.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>廉政專員胡英明代表廉署，成功連任國際反貪局聯合會主席。</p><p></p><p>廉政專員胡英明表示：「非常感謝中央人民政府及香港特別行政區政府，全力支持廉署出選聯合會主席及參與國際反貪工作，今次成功連任，除了感謝國際反貪局聯合會，亦充分展示聯合會成員高度認同廉署的領導成效。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ICAC-1500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IsWg6Qzh2X1795769001.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/>胡英明出席在摩洛哥舉行的國際反貪局聯合會會員大會，在全球逾300名反貪機構代表出席下成功連任。</p><p></p><p>新一屆任期是三年，胡英明指會積極推動多邊合作，建立更強大聯合會。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.955973+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:16.691658+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:17.338089+00:00","content_hash":"2252fde80440c0ba3bb8d2cbcbf245789ac02218bee3398c22f72ba8f17c3135","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}